{
  "epId": 10808,
  "name": "五大罪人",
  "desc": "<p>坎瑞亚的五位重要人物，他们共同执掌着深渊的力量，而这股力量足以摧毁一整个世界。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/23/326985891/93cd2bc9b90c8b87b1f8cbdbe95b4b9d_893994204949566668.png",
  "menuId": 23,
  "menuName": "组织",
  "version": 1780811803,
  "components": {
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "五大罪人"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7484,
        "name": "维瑟弗尼尔",
        "desc": "<p>坎瑞亚「五大罪人」之一的「预言家」，戴因斯雷布的哥哥。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/30/317661877/0de0f341fb6d635a244abdc184e5ebb7_8578683814095246449.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "「预言家」，戴因斯雷布的哥哥，他因向伊尔明国王作出的预言而被刺瞎双眼。在将维瑟弗尼尔从囚牢中释放的期间，他与另外四位坎瑞亚的重要人物一同瓜分了深渊的力量。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7486,
        "name": "雷利尔",
        "desc": "<p>坎瑞亚的「五大罪人」之一的「猎月人」。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/30/317661877/513d51e0ebfd54f5da34a9f85dfaf61f_4832351277427806587.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "「猎月人」，戴因斯雷布的好友。他是伊尔明国王麾下的特务，负责肃清「赤月王朝」的后裔。他借助深渊的力量，想带回自己的挚爱索琳蒂丝。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7485,
        "name": "苏尔特洛奇",
        "desc": "<p>坎瑞亚「五大罪人」之一的「极恶骑」。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/12/30/317661877/1aa2b12fd39ba2ce29de2d75d93570b4_5028363022381563137.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "「极恶骑」，戴因斯雷布的好友，",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4582,
        "name": "丝柯克",
        "desc": "<p>「公子」达达利亚的师父，「极恶骑」苏尔特洛奇的徒弟，行走于深渊之中的至强武者，身世极为神秘。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/01/10/157749474/1e2cb29d039dddf84b706c655ed6367a_815919812194502880.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的师傅，",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4572,
        "name": "吞星之鲸",
        "desc": "<p>无光星海彼端的访客</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2023/12/26/157749474/d6f05906844b79f1be3d4f049381a60f_6497577304666320901.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 7
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的主人。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6368,
        "name": "莱茵多特",
        "desc": "<p>艾莉丝的好友，阿贝多的师父及制作者，被称为「黄金」的女性炼金术士。坎瑞亚的贤者与首席炼金术师，坎瑞亚的「五大罪人」之一。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/09/07/59155606/02619155b165c5a6ed0109b4b61c9ad7_2159470782819424628.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "「黄金」，是一位伟大的炼金术士，运用炼金术创造了兽境猎犬，",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4903,
        "name": "杜林",
        "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45)\">漆黑的大蛇，同时也是炼金术士「莱茵多特」的众多孩子之一。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/04/20/288375639/206a8a0bc1698ae7019f093470f9e845_288347323375183610.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "，",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4914,
        "name": "厄里那斯",
        "desc": "<p>于500年前的灾厄期间出现在枫丹的深渊巨兽。厄里那斯是美露莘一族的「父亲」。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/04/18/142453215/fa4c986eefe97522566b35be6e29e7a0_7745831323711125730.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "和",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 47,
        "name": "阿贝多",
        "desc": "西风骑士团首席炼金术士兼调查小队队长，被称做「白垩之子」的天才。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/b71663c01dc525a09e5591522d2d7943_625618156455509442.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5748,
        "name": "魔女会",
        "desc": "<p>一个在茶会上讨论秘密，并探索世界树的秘密结社。魔女会一共有八位魔女。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/18/326985891/7e361b6e509e4197a2d7ce89f277c472_1815518463202639303.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的成员之一。她的造物在五百年前的灾厄期间入侵了提瓦特。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7483,
        "name": "海洛塔帝",
        "desc": "<p>坎瑞亚「五大罪人」之一的「贤者」。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/30/317661877/513d51e0ebfd54f5da34a9f85dfaf61f_4989545686332548067.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "「贤者」，深秘院院长，首席御前法师。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物关系"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4811,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 22
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "五大罪人本应是阻止灾祸、制止黑王继续动摇世界根基的人。但他们无法抗拒深渊的召唤，将足以毁灭世界的力量瓜分。他们成为了拥有撼动世界之力的超凡存在。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5744,
        "name": "戴因斯雷布",
        "desc": "<p>坎瑞亚末代宫廷卫队的「末光之剑」，蒙受了来自天空岛的不死诅咒。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/06/26/59155606/385d810ab3166799fc6ea831619f5ef6_5129310545559016295.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "戴因斯雷布是唯一一个没有瓜分深渊力量的人。他发誓要阻止五大罪人和",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7784,
        "name": "深渊教团",
        "desc": "<p>一个由受诅咒的坎瑞亚人和非人魔物组成的组织。他们是地表文明的敌人，活跃于世界的诸多角落。他们主要目标是摧毁七神统治下的世界。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/21/326985891/93cd2bc9b90c8b87b1f8cbdbe95b4b9d_9154164356018761697.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
